    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 162 units at 8.6 units per day for 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 26 units at 1.5 units per day for 18 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies PD-Rx Pharmaceuticals, Inc. as the labeler and plant with FEI 1641825.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1331942 of PD-Rx Pharmaceuticals, Inc. ended 2026-08-20 with VAI classification and was known 2026-10-12.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Prior FDA inspections of the same plant in 2015-12-04 and 2022-11-10 were also classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Cosette Pharmaceuticals, Inc. is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place; verify Cosette's current stock and plant registration before purchasing.",
